        "text": "Selected Answer: D. Option D is correct. You need loadbalancer and dns to name your 3 services (yourcompany.com/path). without it, if you select answer B, you will have cloudFunctionName-1/path, cloudFunctionName-2/path, cloudFunctionName-3/path. Its ruined user experience. (2 votes)"
