        "user": "phantomsg",
        "text": "Selected Answer: B. There's no purpose for a Load Balancer here as you are not balancing traffic across multiple backend server instances. You need 3 different Cloud Functions each with their own Endpoint that's all. See this example: https://cloud.google.com/functions/docs/create-deploy-gcloud-1st-gen"
