        "text": "Selected Answer: D. Setting the \"Minimum Wait time\" to 0 seconds means that there is no delay in launching the new instances after the instance template is updated, allowing you to deploy the fix for the critical vulnerability immediately. On the other hand, setting the \"Update mode to Opportunistic\" would mean that the new instances are created at an opportune time and may result in a delay in deploying the fix.... (2 votes)"
